    "content": "如何在 Swing Catalyst 中导出学生详细信息\n本文介绍如何导出保存在 Swing Catalyst 数据库中的所有学生联系信息。\nLooking to export raw data values? See how to export data for how to export force data etc: export-raw-data.md\nIn Swing Catalyst, open the Explorer, then click on the Export button.\nClick Student contact information\nSelect where to save the csv file:\nNote: You may have to rename the file to students.csv in order for it to be recognized in your spreadsheet viewer\nLast updated: 2020-08-14 | View on official support site",
