    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst 支持 \u003e 账户与设置",
    "content": "如何使用日志发送工具 介绍 本文介绍如何将 Swing Catalyst 日志发送给支持团队，有时需要这样做来帮助解决客户遇到的问题。日志包含在 Swing Catalyst 中执行和存储的所有内容的信息，也可能包含有关计算机和 Windows 用户的信息，但仅用于帮助识别问题，该信息永远不会与第三方共享。\n适用于 支持团队要求您发送日志文件。\n您想报告一个错误。\n解决方案 打开 Windows 开始菜单。\n在搜索字段中输入 Swing Catalyst Log Sender。\nWindows 8:\nPress the Windows key on your keyboard, and then write log sender (similarly to the example in Windows 7). Enter your name, email and a short comment, then click the “Send logs” button. How to manually send logs to support There are cases where support wants specific log information from an incident.\nPlease note that this is only necessary if support personnel specifically asks for log files to be sent in this fashion.\nIf you know the approximate time of when you ran into problems please send the file with the time modified date that is closest to when the issue occurred.\nThe path where log files are stored is: C:\\ProgramData\\Swing Catalyst\\logs.\nGo to the ProgramData directory, type `%programdata% in the Windows File explorer and hit enter.\nOpen the Swing Catalyst directory, then open the log directory.\nCopy the log.txt file and the previously last modified log file.\nAttach it to the support ticket or email you are sending to support.\nLast updated: 2023-12-15 | View on official support site",
    "description": "本文描述如何将 Swing Catalyst 日志发送给支持团队，这有时需要帮助解决客户遇到的问题。",
