    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst 支持 \u003e 摄像机和视频",
    "content": "如何对 FLIR Blackfly S 进行固件升级 本文介绍了如何升级 FLIR Blackfly S GigE BFS-PGE-04S2C-CS 的固件。\n警告：如果摄像头产品型号不匹配 BFS-PGE-04S2C-CS，请勿继续进行固件升级 要求： Spinaker SpinView software (see flir-blackfly-gige-setup.md) for details.\nFLIR Blackfly S BFS-PGE-04S2C-CS camera.\nDownload the firmware update, double click on the zip file and extract the ez2 file by clicking Extract all.\nStart SpinView (Windows Start Menu, type SpinView), click Spinview icon.\nRight click the camera you wish to update and click: Update Device Firmware.\nDownload the firmware file if you haven’t already:\nhttps://cloudfront.swingcatalyst.com/files/bfs_ge_imx287_2005.0000.066.000.zip \u0026 extract the zip file.\nSelect the firmware file that you have downloaded.\nClick Start and then click Yes\nLink to old firmware: https://cloudfront.swingcatalyst.com/files/bfs_ge_imx287.zip\nLast updated: 2021-06-16 | View on official support site",
