    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst 支持 \u003e 软件与功能",
    "content": "介绍 本文旨在展示Swing Catalyst新图表库中包含的新功能（版本9.7及更新版本）\n功能包括： 使用鼠标/键盘对图表进行缩放和平移。\n支持在Dual Motion Plate / Dual Force Plate设置中显示每个压力板的单独数据。\n大幅提升渲染性能。\n详细信息：\nCTRL + 鼠标滚轮将在鼠标指针所在的图表位置放大/缩小。\nCTRL SHIFT + 鼠标滚轮进行平移。\n双击重置缩放级别。\n点击并拖动进行缩放。\n让我们来看看这些功能！\n缩放功能 点击并拖动 点击并拖动选择要仔细查看的部分。 提示：双击鼠标重置缩放级别。\nCtrl Scroll zoom Hold CTRL while scrolling the mouse to zoom in / out on the data.\nHold Shift while scrolling the mouse to zoom about the X-axis.\nTip: To reset, double click the mouse.\nZooming about the X-axis (Ctrl Shift Scroll):\nPanning Ctrl Shift Scroll to pan Viewing individual plate data Note: This is Dual Motion Plate / Dual Force plate specific functionality With dual force plates it’s possible to view data from each plate individually by clicking the plate indicator button to the left of the gear icon. The highlighted plate indicates which plate is being displayed.\nIn this example we’re viewing combined data (topmost graph), but also data from each plate individually (left \u0026 right foot):\nGraph viewing options Clicking the gear icon gives you options on how to view the data. For example to show data in percentage or Newtons (or Pound foot: lbf⋅ft, if Imperial is selected in General Settings).\nImproved performance The new graph library can utilize graphics cards for hardware acceleration, this means a significantly more responsive user experience without any significant costs (in terms of CPU and memory usage).\nLast updated: 2024-02-16 | View on official support site",
    "description": "本文旨在演示 Swing Catalyst（9.7 版本及更新版本）中包含的新图形库的新功能",
