    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst 支持 \u003e 软件与功能",
    "content": "如何将应用中录制的视频分享到云端及其他方式 首先，让我们导航到位于应用底部的\"资源管理器\"按钮。在这里您应该能看到在此设备上录制的所有视频以及已下载的视频。 Select the swing you would like to share and press the “upload” button. After it’s done uploading press the “share” button. Here you will have a few choices on how to share the video including sending to another registered Swing Catalyst online user. Simply search for the desired recipient by first and or last name and as long as they have registered for a free online account you should find them in the list. If not check with the recipient to see if they have signed up or maybe used another name. Lastly you will have a choice to add any comments before sending. The recipient should receive an email and notification on on their app once it’s delivered. Last updated: 2021-06-16 | View on official support site",
